# build.sh assembles the .app, the .appex and the framework here, and SwiftPM
# writes .build/. Both are generated: everything that describes them is the
# script and Package.swift, which are the reviewable artefacts.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore already carries a bare `build/` (inherited from the
# Python template), so this file is belt and braces -- kept because a reader
# standing in this directory should not have to know that.
build/
.build/
